1
00:00:00,780 --> 00:00:02,450
[SCOFFS]

2
00:00:02,907 --> 00:00:05,237
Oh, no, he didn't.

3
00:00:08,162 --> 00:00:11,292
So how's it going with Sheldon?
Are you guys still not talking?

4
00:00:11,457 --> 00:00:14,457
(Leonard:)Not only is he still not talking to me,
but he does this thing...

5
00:00:14,627 --> 00:00:17,627
(Leonard:)...where he stares at you
and tries to get your brain to explode.

6
00:00:18,881 --> 00:00:22,421
(Penny:)You know,
like in the classic sci-fi movie Scanners?

7
00:00:22,593 --> 00:00:23,923
Like: Bzz-phew!

8
00:00:25,679 --> 00:00:26,719
(Leonard:)Never mind.

9
00:00:27,181 --> 00:00:29,061
How about this one?

10
00:00:29,225 --> 00:00:32,225
It says, "I know my physics,
but I'm still a fun guy."

11
00:00:32,395 --> 00:00:33,475
(Penny:)Oh.

12
00:00:33,646 --> 00:00:36,526
Oh, I didn't know
they still made corduroy suits.

13
00:00:36,690 --> 00:00:39,280
(Leonard:)They don't. That's why I saved this one.

14
00:00:39,735 --> 00:00:43,075
(Penny:)Okay, well,
let's just see what else you have.

15
00:00:43,239 --> 00:00:48,289
(Penny:)Okay, here.
Take this and this and this...

16
00:00:48,452 --> 00:00:50,912
(Penny:)- ...and these.
- Is this stuff you want me to try on?

17
00:00:51,080 --> 00:00:53,790
(Penny:)No, this is stuff I want you to throw out.

18
00:00:53,958 --> 00:00:57,958
(Penny:)Seriously, don't even give it to charity.
You won't be helping anyone.

19
00:00:58,421 --> 00:01:00,211
What's this?

